// Introduced Names: names a card's own text gives an object that are not card names. Most name a
// token the card creates [CR#111.4] (*create Angelo, a legendary 1/1 green and white Dog creature
// token*, *a colorless artifact token named Lotus*); a few name a permanent or a copy the card
// changes (*She's a land named Moon*). Each lists the cards whose text uses it, which are the only
// cards on which it is in scope. A name that is also a card name is that card's name, in scope
// everywhere, and is not listed here; neither is a predefined token's name (`tokens.ron`).
